":"/designFacts/seojin.single_image.prohibition.skin_shading.v4/value","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.face.v4","seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.skin_shading.v4","statement":"피부에 사실적 또는 단계적인 셰이딩을 넣지 않는다."}},{"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.stains.v4","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v4.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.single_image.prohibition.stains.v4/value","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v4","seojin.appearance.materials.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.stains.v4","statement":"옷과 장비에 얼룩 렌더링을 넣지 않는다."}},{"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.supernatural_body.v4","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v4.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.single_image.prohibition.supernatural_body.v4/value","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v4","seojin.appearance.face.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.supernatural_body.v4","statement":"뿔, 발광 눈, 괴이한 피부색 또는 비인간형 팔다리를 포함하지 않는다."}},{"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.four_head_proportion.v4","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v4.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.single_image.requirement.four_head_proportion.v4/value","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.four_head_proportion.v4","statement":"전신은 3.75–4.25 heads이고 머리 높이는 전신 높이의 24–27%인 약 4등신이어야 하며 팔다리는 짧고 단순해야 한다."}},{"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.identity_points.v4","sourcePath":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v4.json","sourcePointer":"/designFacts/seojin.single_image.requirement.identity_points.v4/value","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.hair.v4","seojin.appearan